  "hints": [
    "Reads are extremely concentrated on the top of the board. What answers those in about a millisecond?",
    "Score writes shouldn't block reads: accept them into a queue and apply them in the background.",
    "LB (3) → API (44) → Redis (3) → NoSQL (3), and API → SQS → workers (3) → NoSQL."
  ],
