  "explanation": [
    "Redis sorted sets (ZADD / ZREVRANGE) give O(log n) rank updates and instant top-N reads, which is the core of every real leaderboard.",
    "Queue score updates so a burst of finished matches never competes with reads; workers apply them to Redis and the durable store.",
    "Shard the board by season or region once one sorted set gets too big for one node."
  ]
